-- Type synonym cycle detection (SHOULD FAIL).
-- A synonym that refers to itself, directly or via other synonyms, has no
-- finite expansion. These declarations used to be accepted and then sent
-- the type checker's synonym expansion into an infinite loop at use sites.
DECLARE Loop IS A Loop

DECLARE Ping IS A Pong
DECLARE Pong IS A Ping

GIVETH A Loop
oops MEANS 42
